article en "Explicit archive PageSet resolution"
body
  cons paragraph
    cons sentence
      cons code "pages::archive::resolve"
      cons text " opts into the archive identity profile."
      nil
    cons sentence
      cons text " Ordinary "
      cons code "pages::resolve"
      cons text " keeps the legacy profile."
      nil
    cons " Both snapshot the original Budget limits and current depth, check page/file registrations before encoding, preserve page order, check labels, derive requirements, and resolve page/file targets and fragments in the same order with the same cumulative Budget."
    cons " Native structure proofs remain scoped to the exact borrowed PageSet."
    cons " No asset or guest lowering success is implied."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons "The archive profile uses the exact checked PageSetArchive envelope for the set digest and each contained DocumentArchive envelope for its document digest."
    cons sentence
      cons text " Domains are "
      cons code "NEPL3.Doc.Archive.Pages.v1\\0"
      cons text " and "
      cons code "NEPL3.Doc.Archive.Document.v1\\0"
      cons text " respectively."
      nil
    cons sentence
      cons text " Each original group's compact v2 entry commitment is wrapped by "
      cons code "NEPL3.Doc.Archive.Guest.v1\\0"
      cons text " before requirement derivation."
      nil
    cons " Existing legacy domains are unchanged."
    cons " These profiles deliberately have different document/guest identities although their original document contents and link semantics may agree."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons "CheckedPages exposes PageIdentityProfile."
    cons " Its plan, document_digest and into_plan refer to that profile; consumers must select a compatible identity contract rather than infer it from positional field shapes."
    cons " This marker is native metadata, not a portable proof."
    cons sentence
      cons text " The existing PageLinkPlan data schema can carry either profile's values, but the explicit archive plan adapters recompute archive resolution and compare canonical plan commitments under "
      cons code "NEPL3.Doc.Archive.PagePlan.v1\\0"
      cons text "."
      nil
    cons " Legacy plans reject through archive adapters and archive plans reject through legacy adapters."
    cons " Decoding a supplied plan never creates CheckedPages."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons "No default Markdown, HTML, Text or Print renderer is switched by these APIs."
    cons " Tools profile selection and replay receipts require a separate explicit integration."
    cons " The historical23page corpus must still be tested under the unchanged normal4B budget before claiming recovery."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons "The explicit archive resolver reports a nested boundary stop as its top-level PageError::Stopped while retaining the Budget's original sticky reason."
    cons " Legacy error classification is unchanged."
    cons " The archive plan boundary shares this rule through its normal PortableError conversion."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons sentence
      cons text "The opt-in tools consumer is specified in "
      cons link relative "31-compact-markdown-pages.md" none text "compact Markdown pages"
      cons text "."
      nil
    nil
  nil
